<doc id="38741" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=38741" title="Eva Braun">
Eva Braun

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Eva Anna Paula Braun (&lt;a href="M%C3%BCnchen"&gt;München&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="6%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;6 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="30%20April"&gt;30 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt;) punika &lt;a href="wanita%20simpenan"&gt;wanita simpenan&lt;/a&gt; lan dados garwanipun &lt;a href="Adolf%20Hitler"&gt;Adolf Hitler&lt;/a&gt; namung satunggal &lt;a href="dina"&gt;dinten&lt;/a&gt; lan satunggal &lt;a href="wengi"&gt;wengi&lt;/a&gt;.
Eva Braun miyos ing &lt;a href="Munchen"&gt;Munchen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; lan pepanggihan kaliyan &lt;a href="Adolf%20Hitler"&gt;Adolf Hitler&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt; nalika yuswa 17. Ing wekdal samanten, panjenangipun punika asisten satunggiling &lt;a href="juru%20foto"&gt;juru foto&lt;/a&gt; Hitler. Ing taun &lt;a href="1936"&gt;1936&lt;/a&gt; piyambakipun dados &lt;a href="pacangan"&gt;pacangan&lt;/a&gt;ipun Hitler. Tanggal &lt;a href="29%20April"&gt;29 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt;, nalika &lt;a href="Tentara%20Abrit"&gt;Tentara Abrit&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Uni%20Sovy%C3%A8t"&gt;Uni Sovyèt&lt;/a&gt; sampun wonten ing kitha &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt;, panjenenganipun mantènan kaliyan Hitler. Sedinten salajanegipun, kekalihipun &lt;a href="nglalu"&gt;nglalu&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="dhisin"&gt;dhisin&lt;/a&gt;ipun dipunobong.

</doc>
